Well-loved Dodge Ram 1500 Conversion Van for sale. 159,276 miles on the original 5.2L V8 engine and transmission. Over the years our family of 3 has taken this van all over the West Coast, up into Yellowstone, through Utah, and countless nights at local beaches and campgrounds. 

We got it 8 years ago from a family in San Diego and have most of the service and maintenance records from then on. We rebuilt the front end about 3 years ago, with a new steering box, control arms, etc. We also installed a backup camera and alarm system. Interior is in great shape with a custom queen size platform bed, lots of storage, 3 captains chairs, and original overhead cabinets and trim. 

There are 200 watts of solar panels flush mounted to the roof and a 200Ah 12v battery back with a 2000 watt inverter for power. We tend to use the power to charge devices and run interior lights and exterior lights at the campsite, heater or fan depending on the weather, and a tea kettle and one-burner induction stove to cook, which we do on the flip down table built into the side door. Batteries, solar set-up, and 2000 watt inverter come with the van. Downsides are, the exterior is in need of paint, there is a small crack in the windshield, it needs a new alternator, and there is a creaky gremlin in the suspension somewhere that I have been chasing for years and can't find. We will be sad to see the van go, but happy to have it go to a new home.",gas,11,,,,,159276,white,2026-06-23T17:55:29.012565,,2002 Dodge Conversion Camper Van,clean,,automatic,,van,2B6HB11Y52K143121,
