1113,,4 cylinders,fwd,1.5L Plug-in Hybrid I4 212hp Fuel: ��� Hybrid ��� Transmission: Automatic Drivetrain: Front Wheel Drive Title: Clear   Asking Price:  $9,,,1,"QR Code Link to This Post    ����2018 Honda Clarity Plug-In Hybrid Touring Sedan����2018 Honda Clarity Plug-In Hybrid Touring - 1 Owner -Well MaintainedExterior Color: Crystal Black PearlInterior Color: BlackVIN: JHMZC5F34JC006721Stock Number: 16598Mileage: 175,535MPG: 44 City / 40 HighwayEngine: 1.5L Plug-in Hybrid I4 212hpFuel: ��� Hybrid ���Transmission: AutomaticDrivetrain: Front Wheel DriveTitle: ClearAsking Price: Key Features:Automatic Climate ControlAirbagsCruise ControlIntroducing the 2018 Honda Clarity Plug-In Hybrid Touring, a sophisticated blend of efficiency, technology, and comfort. This vehicle is powered by a 1.5L Plug-in Hybrid I4 engine, delivering an impressive 212 horsepower, ensuring a dynamic driving experience while maintaining exceptional fuel economy. With an EPA rating of 44 MPG in the city and 40 MPG on the highway, the Clarity is designed to minimize your environmental footprint without sacrificing performance.**Exterior:**Dressed in a stunning Crystal Black Pearl finish, the exterior of the Honda Clarity exudes a modern and elegant aesthetic. The sleek lines and aerodynamic design not only enhance its visual appeal but also contribute to improved efficiency. The vehicle features LED headlights and taillights, providing enhanced visibility and a distinctive look, while the 18-inch alloy wheels add a touch of sophistication to its profile.**Interior:**Step inside to experience a refined interior that seamlessly combines luxury and functionality. The cabin is adorned with premium black leather upholstery, offering both comfort and style. The spacious interior is designed to accommodate five passengers comfortably, with ample legroom and headroom throughout.The Touring trim level comes equipped with a range of advanced technology features, including a 7-inch touchscreen infotainment system that integrates seamlessly with Apple CarPlay and Android Auto, allowing you to stay connected on the go. The premium audio system delivers an immersive listening experience, while the navigation system ensures that you always find your way with ease.**Comfort and Convenience:**The Clarity is designed with your convenience in mind. Enjoy features such as dual-zone automatic climate control, a power-adjustable driver's seat, and heated front seats, ensuring a comfortable ride regardless of the weather. The vehicle also includes a smart key entry system with push-button start, making access effortless.**Safety Features:**Safety is paramount in the Honda Clarity, which comes equipped with Honda Sensing, a suite of advanced safety and driver-assist technologies. This includes collision mitigation braking, road departure mitigation, adaptive cruise control, and lane-keeping assist, providing peace of mind on every journey.**Condition:**This 2018 Honda Clarity Plug-In Hybrid Touring is in excellent overall condition, having had only one previous owner and a clean CARFAX report, ensuring its reliability and integrity. It represents a unique opportunity to own a vehicle that perfectly balances performance, efficiency, and luxury.Experience the future of driving with the 2018 Honda Clarity Plug-In Hybrid TouringAnytime Auto Group4904 Van Nuys Blvd.Sherman Oaks, CA 91403-1701(818) 510-0472Visit our YouTube channel for the walk around video of this vehicle:https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCycqvcSIZWZiOgtNEwLjfnAContact Info:Anytime Auto Group����(818) 510-0472��������4904 Van Nuys Blvd.Sherman Oaks, CA 91403-1701����www.anytimeauto.comTEXT OR CALL US @ 818-446-1393See this vehicle on our websiteDisclaimer:* All advertised prices exclude government fees and taxes, any finance charges, any dealer document processing charge, any electronic filing charge, and any emission testing charge or any financial institution fees. Vehicle specific information is based off stan