 connectivity: Subaru STARLINK infotainment system with a touchscreen display, Bluetooth hands-free phone and audio streaming, USB/AUX inputs, and an integrated audio system designed for clear, user-friendly media and navigation control. - Exterior and utility: Ice Silver Metallic paint over a durable body with roof rails for extra cargo-carrying capability, alloy wheels, daytime running lights and fog lamps for improved visibility, and a practical liftgate for convenient loading. - Safety equipment: A comprehensive suite of passive and active safety features including a rearview camera, multiple airbags, anti-lock brakes (ABS), and electronic stability and traction control. Touring trim also integrates advanced driver convenience and awareness systems as part of Subaru's safety package offerings.Why this Forester stands outThis 2.0XT Touring combines the performance and responsiveness of a turbocharged engine with Subaru's legendary all-wheel-drive capability, wrapped in a well-appointed, top-trim interior. With low, owner-friendly mileage, complete service documentation and a clean CARFAX showing only one owner, this Forester is an excellent choice for a buyer seeking a blend of practicality, comfort and spirited driving capability.For more information, full equipment verification, or to schedule a test drive, please contact us we'll be happy to provide additional details and a vehicle history summary.Anytime Auto Group4904 Van Nuys Blvd.Sherman Oaks, CA 91403-1701(818) 510-0472Visit our YouTube channel for the walk around video of this vehicle:https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCycqvcSIZWZiOgtNEwLjfnAContact Info:Anytime Auto Group����(818) 510-0472��������4904 Van Nuys Blvd.Sherman Oaks, CA 91403-1701����www.anytimeauto.comTEXT OR CALL US @ 818-446-1393See this vehicle on our websiteDisclaimer:* All advertised prices exclude government fees and taxes, any finance charges, any dealer document processing charge, any electronic filing charge, and any emission testing